# Build output: the JSC bundle and the Craft config are both generated.
dist/
# Generated by build:web from the screens directory.
native.config.json
# Generated by build:ios from mobile.config.ts and the bundle. Regenerated in
# full every build, so an edit made here is lost rather than kept.
#
# Anchored. Written as a bare `ios/` this matched every directory of that
# name at any depth, `native/ios/` included — so the Swift the build copies
# from there was silently untracked, and a fresh clone had no provider to
# copy. The build still worked on the machine that wrote the files, which is
# the worst way for this to be wrong.
/ios/
# stx's own compile cache, keyed by content hash. Committed by accident in the
# first mobile commit: it changes on every build, so it turned every diff into
# churn, and a cache that travels between machines is worse than one rebuilt.
.stx/
